i/`, `azure-pipelines.yml`, `Jenkinsfile`, `bitbucket-pipelines.yml`, `.buildkit
e/`, `appveyor.yml` |\n    46\t| Containers | `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`
, `docker-compose.*.yml`, `.dockerignore`, `Containerfile`, `kubernetes/`, `k8s/
