pendent and per-project.\n    10\t\n    11\t## Target User\n    12\t\n    13\tAE
T toolkit users running `aet-ship`, `aet-pipeline-implement`, or `aet-work` — es
pecially those using AFK mode where branch cleanup happens automatically without
