   12\t\n    13\t## Decision\n    14\t\n    15\tEnforce branch safety at the **t
oolkit skill level** rather than relying on project-level `AGENTS.md` rules. Spe
cifically:\n    16\t\n    17\t1. `aet-ship` verifies `git merge-base --is-ancest
or HEAD origin/main` before any branch deletion\n    18\t2. `aet-pipeline-implem
ent` adds a `merged` stage after `synced` to distinguish "docs updated" from "co
de is on main"\n    19\t3. `aet-work` tracks `merge_verified` in the work queue 
