origin/main\n    32\t```\n    33\t\n    34\t`git branch -d <branch>` only checks
if the branch is merged into **local `HEAD`**. It does not check `origin/main`. 
This is a footgun that every AET user will eventually hit.\n    35\t\n    36\t--
-\n    37\t\n    38\t## 3. Proposed Solution: Toolkit-Level Branch Safety\n    3
9\t\n    40\tInstead of requiring every project to add a "Branch Cleanup Safety"
