ly. Below are specific, minimal changes to three skills.\n    41\t\n    42\t---\
n    43\t\n    44\t## 4. Skill-by-Skill Proposals\n    45\t\n    46\t### 4.1 `ae
t-ship` — Add Merge Verification Gate\n    47\t\n    48\t**Current behavior:** `
ship` creates a PR, pushes the branch, and stops. It prints "PR created" and exp
ects the human to merge.\n    49\t\n    50\t**Proposed addition:** After PR crea
tion, add a **merge verification step** that runs before any branch deletion:\n 
  51\t\n    52\t```markdown\n    53\t### `ship` — Step 12: Merge Verification (N
EW)\n    54\t\n    55\tAfter the PR is created and the user indicates it has bee
n merged:\n    56\t\n    57\t1. Run `git fetch origin`\n    58\t2. Verify: `git 
merge-base --is-ancestor HEAD origin/main`\n    59\t3. If the check fails:\n    
60\t   - **STOP** and print:\n    61\t     ```\n    62\t     ⚠️  MERGE VERIFICATI
ON FAILED\n    63\t         This branch\'s commits are NOT ancestors of origin/m
ain.\n    64\t         Possible causes:\n    65\t         - PR was merged locall
y but not pushed\n    66\t         - PR targeted a different base branch\n    67
\t         - A git reset --hard origin/main discarded the merge\n    68\t     \n
