 76\t   - Proceed to branch deletion (Step 13)\n    77\t\n    78\t### `ship` — S
tep 13: Safe Branch Deletion (NEW)\n    79\t\n    80\tOnly run if Step 12 passed
:\n    81\t\n    82\t```bash\n    83\tgit merge-base --is-ancestor HEAD origin/m
ain && git branch -d $(git branch --show-current)\n    84\t```\n    85\t\n    86
\t**Rationale:** This is the exact moment where the pipeline transitions from "c
ode is ready" to "code is on main." The toolkit should own this verification, no
t the human\'s memory or a project-specific AGENTS.md rule.\n    87\t```\n    88
