indings)\n    75\t- MINOR or MAJOR version bump needed\n    76\t\n    77\t**Outp
ut:**\n    78\t\n    79\t- Clean branch with bisectable commits\n    80\t- PR wi
th linked plan.md and PRD\n    81\t- CHANGELOG entry\n    82\t- Version bump\n  
 83\t\n    84\t## Key Principles\n    85\t\n    86\t- **Non-interactive by defau
lt** — the gate runs without human input until something is wrong\n    87\t- **C
omposable** — invokes `aet-review` and `aet-cso` rather than duplicating their l
ogic\n    88\t- **Bisectable commits** — one logical change per commit, enforced
